rule:
This is a radical left instance, with emphasis on leftist inter-tendency discussion.  Leftism here is defined as:
a. Strict anti-capitalism;
b. A revolutionary stance;
c. Solidarity with the entirety of the working class, inclusive of all marginalized groups.

translated text:
This is a radical left instance, with emphasis on leftist inter-tendency discussion.  Leftism here is defined as:
a. Strict anti-capitalism;
b. A revolutionary stance;
c. Solidarity with the entirety of the working class, inclusive of all marginalized groups.

rule:
Giustizia mosse il mio alto fattore;
fecemi la divina podestate,
la somma sapïenza e 'l primo amore.

translated text:
Justice moved my high factor;
made me the divine podestate,
The supreme knowledge is the first love.

